  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "perf(memory): accelerate Buffer.Equals with Hardware Cascade SIMD and refactor Pool API\n\n      Perform SIMD optimization for `Buffer.Equals` ignoreCase comparison:\n      - Implement Cascade SIMD pipeline (Vector512 -> Vector256 -> Vector128 -> Branchless Scalar Tail) for `ReadOnlySpan<byte>\n      ` case-folded ASCII comparison, achieving 16x-28x latency reduction (down to ~9.8ns for 256 bytes).\n      - Use `stackalloc` with `Encoding.UTF8.GetMaxByteCount` for `Equals(byte, char)` to maintain 100% Zero-Allocation and prevent buffer overflows.\n      - Eliminate unnecessary heap allocations during span comparisons.\n\n      Refactor `Pool<T>` management and expose generic array pooling via `Lucifer`:\n      - Enforce internal scope for `Pool<T>` to encourage API access directly through `Lucifer.Rent<T>()` / `Lucifer.Return<T>()`.\n      - Expand `Lucifer` array pooling API from byte-only buffers to generic array types `T[]` via `ArrayPool<T>.Shared`.",
